# E7006 — OHOS Clang linker 的宿主运行库闭包
id: E7006
trigger_tool: clang|cmake|conan
phase: environment|compilation|testing
error_signature: "Error loading shared library libxml2.so.16|Error relocating .* lld: .* symbol not found|unable to execute command"
severity: 1
category: ohos-cross-linker-runtime
match_keywords: OHOS clang, lld, libxml2.so.16, LD_LIBRARY_PATH, compiler_executables, task-owned environment
title: Bind the OHOS linker host runtime beside the selected LLVM toolchain
root_cause: A target worker may expose a clang wrapper in one directory while its lld binary loads host-side shared libraries from a versioned SDK llvm/lib directory. CMake invoked with env=None does not inherit a usable runtime path, so compilation succeeds until lld starts and fails to load libxml2.so.16 or relocations.
affected_scope: OHOS cross-builds whose compiler wrapper and versioned SDK runtime libraries are separated, especially Conan recipes that invoke CMake with an explicit environment boundary.
verification_cmd: Before CMake configure, resolve the compiler-adjacent versioned SDK llvm/lib directory containing libxml2.so.16, prepend it to the task process LD_LIBRARY_PATH, then verify the CMake compiler probe and consumer link complete.
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: task-owned-llvm-runtime-path
rec_description: Discover only compiler-adjacent SDK llvm/lib candidates containing the required host linker runtime, prepend the selected directory to the current process environment, and keep shared tool directories untouched.
rec_command: test -f <sdk>/ohos/native/llvm/lib/libxml2.so.16 && LD_LIBRARY_PATH=<sdk>/ohos/native/llvm/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH cmake -S . -B build
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: recipe-and-test-package-runtime-helper
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: fail-closed-runtime-discovery
fallback_description: If no compiler-adjacent SDK runtime contains the required lld dependency, stop the build and record the missing closure instead of guessing a system library path.
fallback_command: test -f <candidate>/libxml2.so.16
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: explicit-diagnostic
forbid_1_pattern: run.*lld.*without.*LD_LIBRARY_PATH|copy.*libxml2.*system|guess.*sdk.*path
forbid_1_reason: A target-invalid or shared system library can make the linker appear available while changing the worker environment or ABI closure.
forbid_1_consequence: CMake probes fail late or pass against an unrelated host library, making the OHOS binary and CI evidence non-reproducible.
principles: R16,R26,R33
causes: []
caused_by: []
similar_to: []
conflicts_with: []
prerequisite_of: []
